  "comment": "Static palette-screen qualification on client 26430625 only. PaletteBuild fills a dynamic array of 72-byte item views from the local player's and station's models plus unlocked palettes. PaletteGrid takes the tint state, whose palette array is at +0x90b80; it overwrites every row's +0x10 count from the two models' Generic-index views at RowCount (eax=count, rbx=row, r15d=item). DetailCount consumes a separate sum in eax for the selected palette (r15d=item). TintCommand emits command 0x6e, storing the target InventorySlotId at +4 and the selected palette's key at +0xc. These are locations only, not a qualified external-source request protocol, and enable no capability.",
